A '''treaty''' was signed between the [[Galactic Republic]] and the [[Dug Council]] during the [[Clone Wars]] following the [[Battle of Malastare]]<ref name="The Zillo Beast" /> in [[21 BBY]].<ref name="Date" /> The treaty gave the Republic access to the [[planet]]'s [[fuel]] [[Malastarian fuel|reserves]] in return for destroying the ancient [[Zillo Beast]] and protection from the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]]. In secret, the [[Jedi Order]] [[stun]]ned the Zillo Beast with the approval of [[Supreme Chancellor]] [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine]] and arranged for the creature to be transported offworld to [[Coruscant]] for scientific research;<ref name="The Zillo Beast" /> leading to the [[Zillo Beast incident]].<ref name="The Zillo Beast Strikes Back">{{TCW|The Zillo Beast Strikes Back}}</ref>

